  "Title": "与自己对话",
  "EpisodeDetail": [
    {
      "Id": 1040310001,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1040310,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 1,
      "SpeakerName": "卡米拉",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "现在的我，还只是单纯的我。",
      "BackgroundImageFileName": "940",
      "BgmFileName": "8",
      "VoiceFileName": "10403100010",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "403"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1040310002,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1040310,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 2,
      "SpeakerName": "卡米拉",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "不是东上野高中的学生。不是辣妹。/n也不是电姬的演员。就只是我。",
      "VoiceFileName": "10403100020",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "403"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1040310003,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1040310,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 3,
      "SpeakerName": "卡米拉",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "——呼。",
      "VoiceFileName": "10403100030",
      "CharacterMotions": [
        {
          "slotNumber": 1,
          "FacialExpressionMasterId": 70,
          "BodyMotionMasterId": 4,
          "LipSyncMasterId": 4,
          "SpineId": 40321,
          "CharacterAppearanceType": 0,
          "CharacterPosition": 3,
          "CharacterLayerType": 1,
          "SpineSize": 2
        }
      ],
      "SpeakerIconId": "403"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1040310004,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1040310,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 4,
      "SpeakerName": "卡米拉",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "（回想一下吧。我为什么加入电姬，/n　又为什么一直在电姬当演员）",
      "VoiceFileName": "10403100040",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "403"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1040310005,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1040310,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 5,
      "SpeakerName": "卡米拉",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "（那是因为——/n　这跟化妆有点像）",
      "VoiceFileName": "10403100050",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "403"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1040310006,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1040310,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 6,
      "SpeakerName": "卡米拉",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "打底先上防晒。提亮是必须的！　/n粉底要有清晰感——等等，黑眼圈都出来了！　这是熊出没吗！？",
      "VoiceFileName": "10403100060",
      "CharacterMotions": [
        {
          "slotNumber": 1,
          "FacialExpressionMasterId": 205,
          "BodyMotionMasterId": 2,
          "LipSyncMasterId": 2,
          "SpineId": 40321,
          "CharacterAppearanceType": 0,
          "CharacterPosition": 3,
          "CharacterLayerType": 1,
          "SpineSize": 2
        }
      ],
      "SpeakerIconId": "403"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1040310007,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1040310,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 7,
      "SpeakerName": "卡米拉",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "别涂太厚……遮瑕就用橘色系。/n橘色真的好啊～。光看着就让人来劲！",
      "VoiceFileName": "10403100070",
      "CharacterMotions": [
        {
          "slotNumber": 1,
          "FacialExpressionMasterId": 103,
          "BodyMotionMasterId": 11,
          "LipSyncMasterId": 2,
          "SpineId": 0,
          "CharacterAppearanceType": 0,
          "CharacterPosition": 3,
          "CharacterLayerType": 1,
          "SpineSize": 2
        }
      ],
      "SpeakerIconId": "403"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1040310008,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1040310,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 8,
      "SpeakerName": "卡米拉",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "不过连黑眼圈冒出来都没注意到，我自己都想笑。/n——好了，熊熊回森林去吧。拜～拜！",
      "VoiceFileName": "10403100080",
      "CharacterMotions": [
        {
          "slotNumber": 1,
          "FacialExpressionMasterId": 201,
          "BodyMotionMasterId": 20,
          "LipSyncMasterId": 1,
          "SpineId": 0,
          "CharacterAppearanceType": 0,
          "CharacterPosition": 3,
          "CharacterLayerType": 1,
          "SpineSize": 2
        }
      ],
      "SpeakerIconId": "403"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1040310009,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1040310,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 9,
      "SpeakerName": "卡米拉",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "然后我属于先画眼妆派。眼睛当然要最先啪地定下来！",
      "VoiceFileName": "10403100090",
      "CharacterMotions": [
        {
          "slotNumber": 1,
          "FacialExpressionMasterId": 101,
          "BodyMotionMasterId": 8,
          "LipSyncMasterId": 2,
          "SpineId": 0,
          "CharacterAppearanceType": 0,
          "CharacterPosition": 3,
          "CharacterLayerType": 1,
          "SpineSize": 2
        }
      ],
      "SpeakerIconId": "403"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1040310010,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1040310,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 10,
      "SpeakerName": "卡米拉",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "眼影自然加深层次，再用眼线啪地把眼神拉满！　/n能画出像猫一样可爱的感觉，心情一下就会飞起来！　这可是小知识！",
      "VoiceFileName": "10403100100",
      "CharacterMotions": [
        {
          "slotNumber": 1,
          "FacialExpressionMasterId": 205,
          "BodyMotionMasterId": 17,
          "LipSyncMasterId": 2,
          "SpineId": 0,
          "CharacterAppearanceType": 0,
          "CharacterPosition": 3,
          "CharacterLayerType": 1,
          "SpineSize": 2
        }
      ],
      "SpeakerIconId": "403"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1040310011,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1040310,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 11,
      "SpeakerName": "卡米拉",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "等等，又没在直播，我怎么还自己说起来了。笑死。/n都这样了，是不是干脆开直播更好？",
      "VoiceFileName": "10403100110",
      "CharacterMotions": [
        {
          "slotNumber": 1,
          "FacialExpressionMasterId": 202,
          "BodyMotionMasterId": 11,
          "LipSyncMasterId": 1,
          "SpineId": 0,
          "CharacterAppearanceType": 0,
          "CharacterPosition": 3,
          "CharacterLayerType": 1,
          "SpineSize": 2
        }
      ],
      "SpeakerIconId": "403"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1040310012,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1040310,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 12,
      "SpeakerName": "卡米拉",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "不过这个不一样啦～。按蕾前辈的说法，/n这是让我变成“我”的仪式？　之类的？",
      "VoiceFileName": "10403100120",
      "CharacterMotions": [
        {
          "slotNumber": 1,
          "FacialExpressionMasterId": 71,
          "HeadMotionMasterId": 1,
          "BodyMotionMasterId": 3,
          "LipSyncMasterId": 1,
          "SpineId": 0,
          "CharacterAppearanceType": 0,
          "CharacterPosition": 3,
          "CharacterLayerType": 1,
          "SpineSize": 2
        }
      ],
      "SpeakerIconId": "403"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1040310013,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1040310,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 13,
      "SpeakerName": "卡米拉",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "嘿嘿，原来对我来说已经这么理所当然了。",
      "VoiceFileName": "10403100130",
      "CharacterMotions": [
        {
          "slotNumber": 1,
          "FacialExpressionMasterId": 105,
          "BodyMotionMasterId": 11,
          "LipSyncMasterId": 1,
          "SpineId": 0,
          "CharacterAppearanceType": 0,
          "CharacterPosition": 3,
          "CharacterLayerType": 1,
          "SpineSize": 2
        }
      ],
      "SpeakerIconId": "403"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1040310014,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1040310,
      "Order": 2,
      "GroupOrder": 13,
      "SpeakerName": "卡米拉",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "——好，继续！",
      "VoiceFileName": "10403100131",
      "CharacterMotions": [
        {
          "slotNumber": 1,
          "FacialExpressionMasterId": 101,
          "BodyMotionMasterId": 8,
          "LipSyncMasterId": 2,
          "SpineId": 0,
          "CharacterAppearanceType": 0,
          "CharacterPosition": 3,
          "CharacterLayerType": 1,
          "SpineSize": 2
        }
      ],
      "SpeakerIconId": "403"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1040310015,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1040310,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 14,
      "SpeakerName": "卡米拉",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "接下来是眉毛。我的重点是……眉峰的位置。/n我喜欢细眉，所以别显得太凶……好。",
      "VoiceFileName": "10403100140",
      "CharacterMotions": [
        {
          "slotNumber": 1,
          "FacialExpressionMasterId": 103,
          "BodyMotionMasterId": 6,
          "LipSyncMasterId": 1,
          "SpineId": 0,
          "CharacterAppearanceType": 0,
          "CharacterPosition": 3,
          "CharacterLayerType": 1,
          "SpineSize": 2
        }
      ],
      "SpeakerIconId": "403"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1040310016,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1040310,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 15,
      "SpeakerName": "卡米拉",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "左右平衡……OK！　/n把多出来的地方修一下……好，感觉不错！",
      "VoiceFileName": "10403100150",
      "CharacterMotions": [
        {
          "slotNumber": 1,
          "FacialExpressionMasterId": 103,
          "BodyMotionMasterId": 8,
          "LipSyncMasterId": 1,
          "SpineId": 0,
          "CharacterAppearanceType": 0,
          "CharacterPosition": 3,
          "CharacterLayerType": 1,
          "SpineSize": 2
        }
      ],
      "SpeakerIconId": "403"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1040310017,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1040310,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 16,
      "SpeakerName": "卡米拉",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "再用眉粉做出一点蓬松感，然后就轮到睫毛膏！　/n先逆着毛流刷一遍，再顺着刷回来，两段式！",
      "VoiceFileName": "10403100160",
      "CharacterMotions": [
        {
          "slotNumber": 1,
          "FacialExpressionMasterId": 101,
          "BodyMotionMasterId": 10,
          "LipSyncMasterId": 2,
          "SpineId": 0,
          "CharacterAppearanceType": 0,
          "CharacterPosition": 3,
          "CharacterLayerType": 1,
          "SpineSize": 2
        }
      ],
      "SpeakerIconId": "403"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1040310018,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1040310,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 17,
      "SpeakerName": "卡米拉",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "眉毛的存在感别太强，要细一点。/n不然好不容易画出来的眼神都被抢掉，那就没意义了！",
      "VoiceFileName": "10403100170",
      "CharacterMotions": [
        {
          "slotNumber": 1,
          "FacialExpressionMasterId": 103,
          "BodyMotionMasterId": 11,
          "LipSyncMasterId": 1,
          "SpineId": 0,
          "CharacterAppearanceType": 0,
          "CharacterPosition": 3,
          "CharacterLayerType": 1,
          "SpineSize": 2
        }
      ],
      "SpeakerIconId": "403"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1040310019,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1040310,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 18,
      "SpeakerName": "卡米拉",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "腮红也一样。淡淡有点粉就够。/n就是要有好气色，看起来有精神嘛！　毕竟是辣妹！",
      "VoiceFileName": "10403100180",
      "CharacterMotions": [
        {
          "slotNumber": 1,
          "FacialExpressionMasterId": 200,
          "BodyMotionMasterId": 20,
          "LipSyncMasterId": 2,
          "SpineId": 0,
          "CharacterAppearanceType": 0,
          "CharacterPosition": 3,
          "CharacterLayerType": 1,
          "SpineSize": 2
        }
      ],
      "SpeakerIconId": "403"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1040310020,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1040310,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 19,
      "SpeakerName": "卡米拉",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "然后是唇妆……。/n……再用唇蜜做出光泽……。",
      "VoiceFileName": "10403100190",
      "CharacterMotions": [
        {
          "slotNumber": 1,
          "FacialExpressionMasterId": 103,
          "BodyMotionMasterId": 6,
          "LipSyncMasterId": 1,
          "SpineId": 0,
          "CharacterAppearanceType": 0,
          "CharacterPosition": 3,
          "CharacterLayerType": 1,
          "SpineSize": 2
        }
      ],
      "SpeakerIconId": "403"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1040310021,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1040310,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 20,
      "SpeakerName": "卡米拉",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "………………嗯！　超可爱！！　/n真的，我已经能把自己化得这么可爱了！",
      "VoiceFileName": "10403100200",
      "CharacterMotions": [
        {
          "slotNumber": 1,
          "FacialExpressionMasterId": 200,
          "HeadMotionMasterId": 1,
          "BodyMotionMasterId": 13,
          "LipSyncMasterId": 1,
          "SpineId": 0,
          "CharacterAppearanceType": 0,
          "CharacterPosition": 3,
          "CharacterLayerType": 1,
          "SpineSize": 2
        }
      ],
      "SpeakerIconId": "403"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1040310022,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1040310,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 21,
      "SpeakerName": "卡米拉",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "刚开始那会儿可是一塌糊涂！　/n现在看到当时的照片，我都想大喊“这也太离谱了吧～！”",
      "VoiceFileName": "10403100210",
      "CharacterMotions": [
        {
          "slotNumber": 1,
          "FacialExpressionMasterId": 201,
          "BodyMotionMasterId": 11,
          "LipSyncMasterId": 1,
          "SpineId": 0,
          "CharacterAppearanceType": 0,
          "CharacterPosition": 3,
          "CharacterLayerType": 1,
          "SpineSize": 2
        }
      ],
      "SpeakerIconId": "403"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1040310023,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1040310,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 22,
      "SpeakerName": "卡米拉",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "可是，我就是想变成够潮的辣妹。/n看视频、失败、读文章、再试……。",
      "VoiceFileName": "10403100220",
      "CharacterMotions": [
        {
          "slotNumber": 1,
          "FacialExpressionMasterId": 71,
          "BodyMotionMasterId": 4,
          "LipSyncMasterId": 1,
          "SpineId": 0,
          "CharacterAppearanceType": 0,
          "CharacterPosition": 3,
          "CharacterLayerType": 1,
          "SpineSize": 2
        }
      ],
      "SpeakerIconId": "403"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1040310024,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1040310,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 23,
      "SpeakerName": "卡米拉",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "……跟这个是一样的。/n想闪闪发亮。像帅气的辣妹一样。像电姬的舞台一样。",
      "VoiceFileName": "10403100230",
      "CharacterMotions": [
        {
          "slotNumber": 1,
          "FacialExpressionMasterId": 103,
          "HeadMotionMasterId": 1,
          "LipSyncMasterId": 1,
          "SpineId": 0,
          "CharacterAppearanceType": 0,
          "CharacterPosition": 3,
          "CharacterLayerType": 1,
          "SpineSize": 2
        }
      ],
      "SpeakerIconId": "403"
    },
